{"it": [["<li><span class=\"n\">3</span><span><b>Stop</b>: ferma la riproduzione; la testina resta dov'è.</span></li>", "<li><span class=\"n\">3</span><span><b>Pausa</b> (Maiusc + spazio): ferma la riproduzione lasciando la testina dove si trova, senza tornare al punto di partenza; un altro clic sullo stesso tasto riprende da lì. Non agisce durante la registrazione.</span></li><li><span class=\"n\">4</span><span><b>Stop</b>: ferma la riproduzione; con l'opzione <em>Allo stop la testina torna al punto di partenza</em> (menu Trasporto, attiva di norma) la testina torna dove era partita, altrimenti resta dov'è.</span></li>"], ["<span class=\"n\">4</span><span><b>Registra</b> (R)", "<span class=\"n\">5</span><span><b>Registra</b> (R)"], ["<span class=\"n\">5</span><span><b>Timecode</b> della", "<span class=\"n\">6</span><span><b>Timecode</b> della"], ["<span class=\"n\">6</span><span><b>LOOP</b> (L)", "<span class=\"n\">7</span><span><b>LOOP</b> (L)"], ["<span class=\"n\">7</span><span><b>SNAP</b> (N)", "<span class=\"n\">8</span><span><b>SNAP</b> (N)"], ["<span class=\"n\">8</span><span><b>SEGUI</b> (F)", "<span class=\"n\">9</span><span><b>SEGUI</b> (F)"], ["<span class=\"n\">9</span><span>Indicatore del <b>livello", "<span class=\"n\">10</span><span>Indicatore del <b>livello"], ["<span class=\"n\">10</span><span><b>MON</b> (I)", "<span class=\"n\">11</span><span><b>MON</b> (I)"], ["<span class=\"n\">11</span><span><b>−</b> e <b>+</b>", "<span class=\"n\">12</span><span><b>−</b> e <b>+</b>"], ["<span class=\"n\">12</span><span><b>ADATTA</b>", "<span class=\"n\">13</span><span><b>ADATTA</b>"]], "en": [["<li><span class=\"n\">3</span><span><b>Stop</b>: stops playback; the playhead stays where it is.</span></li>", "<li><span class=\"n\">3</span><span><b>Pause</b> (Shift + Space): stops playback and leaves the playhead where it is, without returning to the starting point; another click on the same button resumes from there. It does nothing while recording.</span></li><li><span class=\"n\">4</span><span><b>Stop</b>: stops playback; with the option <em>On stop the playhead returns to where it started</em> (Transport menu, on by default) the playhead goes back to where it started, otherwise it stays where it is.</span></li>"], ["<span class=\"n\">4</span><span><b>Record</b> (R)", "<span class=\"n\">5</span><span><b>Record</b> (R)"], ["<span class=\"n\">5</span><span><b>Timecode</b> of", "<span class=\"n\">6</span><span><b>Timecode</b> of"], ["<span class=\"n\">6</span><span><b>LOOP</b> (L)", "<span class=\"n\">7</span><span><b>LOOP</b> (L)"], ["<span class=\"n\">7</span><span><b>SNAP</b> (N)", "<span class=\"n\">8</span><span><b>SNAP</b> (N)"], ["<span class=\"n\">8</span><span><b>FOLLOW</b> (F)", "<span class=\"n\">9</span><span><b>FOLLOW</b> (F)"], ["<span class=\"n\">9</span><span><b>Input level</b>", "<span class=\"n\">10</span><span><b>Input level</b>"], ["<span class=\"n\">10</span><span><b>MON</b> (I)", "<span class=\"n\">11</span><span><b>MON</b> (I)"], ["<span class=\"n\">11</span><span><b>−</b> and <b>+</b>", "<span class=\"n\">12</span><span><b>−</b> and <b>+</b>"], ["<span class=\"n\">12</span><span><b>FIT</b>:", "<span class=\"n\">13</span><span><b>FIT</b>:"]]}